            <div xml:id="d1046">

                <pb facs="1202" n="1090" xml:id="pg1090"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1123 Winterle/3: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-09-23T11:00:00-04:00">September 23, 1935—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3. Your 7, September 21, noon, and Chefoo’s September 21, 4 p.m., to you.
                    Department wondering why Chefoo has not lodged and you have not recommended
                    lodging charge against Japanese policeman. Please inform Department
                    immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
